@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName sans-serif
skinparam roundCorner 10

title EduCore — Analytics Data Pipeline & Export

actor "Admin (Uni / Dept)" as Admin
participant "EduCore Web App" as App
participant "AnalyticsService" as Analytics
database "PostgreSQL DB" as DB

== Dynamic Dashboard Query ==
Admin -> App : Open /analytics (with department/semester filter)
App -> Analytics : Fetch metrics (enrolment, GPA distribution, tuition)
Analytics -> DB : Execute optimized aggregate queries (GROUP BY, SUM, AVG)
Analytics --> App : Return structured JSON metrics
App --> Admin : Render charts (Pie, Bar, Trendlines)

== CSV & PDF Export ==
alt CSV Export
  Admin -> App : Click 'Export CSV' -> GET /analytics/export
  App -> DB : Query raw tabular metrics
  App --> Admin : Stream download 'analytics_report.csv'
else PDF Executive Report
  Admin -> App : Click 'Export PDF' -> GET /analytics/export/pdf
  App -> App : Render Blade print template & compile PDF
  App --> Admin : Stream download 'analytics_summary.pdf'
end

@enduml
